  <ButtonText>k__BackingField: "L\u2019\xE9quipage va finir par se retourner contre
    lui, il apprendra \xE0 ce moment la\r\n"
  <NpcText>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 292bca25009c3b846973697c392c826a, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 368af27e801a8f643a3763179d93db07, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Justement, j\u2019voudrais \xE9viter qu\u2019\xE7a arrive."
    - "Si la situation d\xE9g\xE9n\xE8re, \xE7a s\u2019ra plus dur d\u2019r\xE9parer
      les d\xE9g\xE2ts."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 292bca25009c3b846973697c392c826a, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 15a032d1f64921b49a6cec6c0a26887d, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Mieux vaut pr\xE9venir que gu\xE9rir comme on dit."
